=====Usage notes=====
* The lower-case form of ''internet'' is much more common in popular usage than the capitalized form ''Internet'', whereas, among [[ISP]] companies, the capitalized form is still the typical form.
* Sense 4 is generally but not exclusively indicated by colloquial (sometimes affected) use of ''don't have'' or ''don't got''.

